205
00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.560
- It becomes one whole cake, right? - Yes.

206
00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:45.219
Adding the original three 0.3333s gives 0.9999,

207
00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:46.690
