Do you think Pi Han-wool will just sit back and watch?

266
00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.920
Pi Han-wool?

267
00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.669
The creator of this ranking app.

268
00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.709
What is this?

269
00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.039
You don't even know this?

270
00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.570
I don't know. What is this?

271
00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.139
The national gang known for its extreme cruelty, the Yeonbaek Gang.

272
00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.349
He is both the son of the gang's boss, Chairman Pi Yeon-baek,

273
00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.000
and the number one ranker in this school.

274
00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.809
The culprit who created this ranking app,

275
00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:17.229
making everyone risk their lives for fighting ranks,

276
00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.430
is Pi Han-wool.

277
00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.919
What does that have to do with us studying?

278
00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:21.960
What I mean is...

279
00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:24.660
Studying at this school is impossible.

280
00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:27.960
(Meteor Senior Vocational High School - 1st Year Placement Exam)

281
00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.430
(Meteor Senior Vocational High School Rank 2/220)

282
00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.509
Let's form a study group together.

283
00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.320
Let's study together and go to college.

284
00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:52.720
(Meteor Senior Vocational High School 1st Year Placement Exam
Rank 2/220)

285
00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.060
Get lost.

286
00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.680
- Se-hyun - I told you to get lost, f***.

287
00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.540
I don't study.

288
00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.509
Cut it out. What do you even know?

289
00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:16.989
- Se-hyun, I just...
- F***, you don't know anything.

290
00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.930
Don't just casually tell me to study.

291
00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.660
F***.

292
00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.120
Class 2-8, Pi Han-wool.

293
00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.329
This student has excellent grades,

294
00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:59.569
and serves as a model for other students in all aspects.

295
00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.560
I hereby present this certificate.

296
00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:04.350
(2024 Academic Excellence Scholarship Certificate Award Ceremony)

297
00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:11.860
- Pi Han-wool - Pi Han-wool

298
00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.150
Seriously, I told you to cut it out.

299
00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:32.740
No... I wasn't talking about you.

300
00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.529
Rank 171 trash.

301
00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.129
Are you trying to pick a fight with me?

302
00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.080
Sorry.

303
00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.260
Do you think just saying sorry will settle it?

304
00:20:47.261 --> 00:20:49.289
It's really not what you think.

305
00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.950
Since you feel sorry, you should compensate me.

306
00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:53.300
Bring 200,000 won by tomorrow.

307
00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:56.470
Um... money...

308
00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.740
F***. Saying sorry with your mouth,

309
00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.940
but ending up doing things that wrong me in the end.

310
00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:06.489
Hey, bring me a baseball bat.

311
00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.700
This guy hasn't grasped the situation yet.

312
00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:08.880
A baseball bat?

313
00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:31.490
Hey, does it hurt?

314
00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:36.950
Seems like this guy is crying.

315
00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.870
Um, Teacher.

316
00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:57.890
I'll do it.

317
00:21:58.470 --> 00:22:02.319
Se-hyun is a prospective member of our study group.

318
00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.320
Get up.

319
00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:07.070
This guy is trying to be smart.

320
00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:04.840
Are you okay?

321
00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:09.830
Why exactly are you messing with me like this?

322
00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:12.720
- What? - Didn't I tell you to leave me alone?

323
00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.570
Why do you always do this?

324
00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:16.639
I just wanted to help you.

325
00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:19.350
You just feel satisfied after helping out,
and then you're done, right?

326
00:23:24.240 --> 00:23:25.379
What do you mean...

327
00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:26.450
Can't you understand?

328
00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:28.530
I was almost done getting beaten up.

329
00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.630
But if I just run away like this,

330
00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:35.640
haven't you thought about how I'll be targeted by them
and bullied all the time?

331
00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.430
Studying? That's great.

332
00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:44.860
I also want to be like you, talking about studying all the time.

333
00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:47.160
But this...

334
00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:51.130
For me, it's a survival issue more important than studying.

335
00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:27.730
Hey, where is that guy?

336
00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:36.490
Who are you talking about?

337
00:24:39.290 --> 00:24:40.890
Are you kidding me?

338
00:24:42.650 --> 00:24:44.240
The guy who sprayed the fire extinguisher.

339
00:24:44.890 --> 00:24:46.060
Is he from our class?

340
00:24:46.860 --> 00:24:48.160
I didn't see clearly either.

341
00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:51.890
Get up, you f***ing punk.

342
00:24:57.650 --> 00:24:59.060
I'll ask you one last time.

343
00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.490
Where is that guy?

344
00:25:03.140 --> 00:25:04.380
I'm very sorry.

345
00:25:05.090 --> 00:25:06.210
I really don't know.

346
00:25:18.060 --> 00:25:20.699
As the saying goes, 'A sound mind in a sound body.'

347
00:25:20.700 --> 00:25:22.439
Because I wanted to become a top student,

348
00:25:22.440 --> 00:25:24.119
from third grade until now,

349
00:25:24.120 --> 00:25:26.799
I have exercised every day without interruption.

350
00:25:26.800 --> 00:25:31.249
Jiamin, all your talent is indeed concentrated in your physical abilities.

351
00:25:31.250 --> 00:25:32.509
So compared to studying,

352
00:25:32.510 --> 00:25:33.659
(Hanlim Gymnasium)
So compared to studying,

353
00:25:33.660 --> 00:25:38.620
(Hanlim Gymnasium)
do you want to follow your uncle and take the path of martial arts?

354
00:25:39.630 --> 00:25:40.949
Look at this kid.

355
00:25:40.950 --> 00:25:41.960
Pretty impressive, huh.

356
00:25:49.450 --> 00:25:50.370
Hey.

357
00:25:50.910 --> 00:25:51.870
Are you alright?

358
00:25:54.210 --> 00:25:56.020
Oh, thank goodness.

359
00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:06.570
Don't have any other worries.

360
00:26:07.190 --> 00:26:08.930
Form a study group with me.

361
00:26:16.760 --> 00:26:17.690
No.

362
00:26:29.610 --> 00:26:32.240
I said no. I won't do it.

363
00:26:35.930 --> 00:26:36.730
Why?

364
00:26:36.731 --> 00:26:38.739
Honestly, you don't have confidence either, do you?

365
00:26:38.740 --> 00:26:39.470
What?

366
00:26:39.471 --> 00:26:41.080
Why pretend you don't know?

367
00:26:41.940 --> 00:26:43.860
That's why you wear a mask, right?

368
00:26:45.350 --> 00:26:47.560
Because you're afraid of being targeted by them.

369
00:27:40.590 --> 00:27:42.130
Learn welding properly.

370
00:27:48.500 --> 00:27:50.030
Why aren't you answering?

371
00:27:50.510 --> 00:27:51.660
Got it.

372
00:27:54.700 --> 00:27:56.979
Going to college is completely useless.

373
00:27:56.980 --> 00:27:58.419
The youngest guy who came to work at the construction site recently,

374
00:27:58.420 --> 00:28:00.450
also graduated from a 4-year university.

375
00:28:02.880 --> 00:28:05.749
You have to have skills to be respected.

376
00:28:05.750 --> 00:28:06.640
Understood?

377
00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:16.270
I understand already, can you stop talking about it?

378
00:28:18.110 --> 00:28:20.020
Aren't I not studying anymore?

379
00:28:20.670 --> 00:28:23.329
I will learn welding and won't go to college.

380
00:28:23.330 --> 00:28:25.550
That's why I came to Meteor Vocational High School.

381
00:28:26.340 --> 00:28:28.160
You little brat, how dare you talk back.

382
00:29:16.940 --> 00:29:20.710
(Math Mistakes Notebook, Kim Se-hyun)

383
00:29:38.310 --> 00:29:39.990
Is Jiamin not joining a study group?

384
00:29:40.570 --> 00:29:43.609
After my son formed a study group with his classmates,

385
00:29:43.610 --> 00:29:46.139
his midterm rank improved by 10 places immediately.

386
00:29:46.140 --> 00:29:47.409
Really?

387
00:29:47.410 --> 00:29:48.980
Tell Jiamin to join one too.

388
00:29:49.800 --> 00:29:51.879
Our study group can't let you join.

389
00:29:51.880 --> 00:29:52.810
Why?

390
00:29:53.430 --> 00:29:54.980
Aren't you at the bottom of our class?

391
00:29:55.750 --> 00:29:58.490
Sorry, our members are decided by everyone's moms.

392
00:29:58.870 --> 00:30:00.060
We can't just let anyone join.

393
00:30:25.550 --> 00:30:30.120
Our study group is already full.

394
00:30:10.380 --> 00:30:11.790
Hey, don't make eye contact with him.

395
00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:15.390
He really has no conscience, just wanting to reap the benefits without working.

396
00:30:15.810 --> 00:30:17.849
Rather than joining a study group,

397
00:30:17.850 --> 00:30:19.340
it would be faster for him to be reincarnated.

398
00:30:25.330 --> 00:30:26.330
Jiamin.

399
00:30:26.730 --> 00:30:30.310
Teacher Han-kyung suddenly had something...

400
00:30:33.180 --> 00:30:34.030
Are you crying?

401
00:30:34.570 --> 00:30:35.470
Why are you crying?

402
00:30:36.570 --> 00:30:37.760
Did something happen?

403
00:30:41.610 --> 00:30:42.919
It's okay.

404
00:30:42.920 --> 00:30:45.100
It's okay if you're not good at studying.

405
00:30:45.920 --> 00:30:46.770
No.

406
00:30:48.010 --> 00:30:49.030
I'm not crying because of that.

407
00:31:22.520 --> 00:31:23.890
I don't want to go to school.

408
00:31:28.320 --> 00:31:30.400
No, I still have to go.

409
00:31:31.780 --> 00:31:33.470
After all, I'm a teacher.

410
00:31:54.380 --> 00:31:56.899
Hey, stop smoking. Go inside quickly.

411
00:31:56.900 --> 00:31:58.289
Go inside quickly. Why aren't you putting out your cigarettes?

412
00:31:58.290 --> 00:31:59.679
I just lit it!

413
00:31:59.680 --> 00:32:01.410
You punks, go inside now!

414
00:32:02.650 --> 00:32:03.879
Hey, you guys over there, go inside quickly too!

415
00:32:03.880 --> 00:32:04.880
The Dean of Students is coming. Let's go.

416
00:32:04.881 --> 00:32:06.579
Good morning, Dean.

417
00:32:06.580 --> 00:32:07.899
Stop saying good morning.

418
00:32:07.900 --> 00:32:09.429
Hurry up and clear out all the oil drums.

419
00:32:09.430 --> 00:32:10.320
What?

420
00:32:10.321 --> 00:32:11.899
Because the inspector is suddenly coming,

421
00:32:11.900 --> 00:32:13.289
the Vice Principal is worried sick.

422
00:32:13.290 --> 00:32:15.029
I'll leave these oil drums to you to handle.

423
00:32:15.030 --> 00:32:15.930
But...

424
00:32:40.030 --> 00:32:41.219
Thank you.

425
00:32:41.220 --> 00:32:43.050
By the way, what's your name?

426
00:32:43.650 --> 00:32:45.500
My name is Park Geon-yeop.

427
00:32:46.410 --> 00:32:47.400
Okay, Geon-yeop.

428
00:32:47.400 --> 00:32:48.160
Yes.

429
00:32:49.400 --> 00:32:51.369
But these ashtrays,

430
00:32:51.370 --> 00:32:54.180
wouldn't it be better to just leave them for the inspector to see?

431
00:32:56.610 --> 00:32:59.500
Actually, I thought so too.

432
00:32:59.890 --> 00:33:01.370
But this is our school after all.

433
00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:05.859
Even if you go through all this trouble alone, this school won't change.

434
00:33:05.860 --> 00:33:08.690
Although what you're saying is not wrong,

435
00:33:10.250 --> 00:33:12.550
giving up just like that would be too embarrassing.

436
00:33:13.660 --> 00:33:15.819
Anyway, I'll take care of the rest.

437
00:33:15.820 --> 00:33:17.590
You hurry inside for class.

438
00:33:18.100 --> 00:33:19.060
Goodbye.

439
00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:20.710
Okay.

440
00:34:12.170 --> 00:34:16.569
(Math Mistakes Notebook)

441
00:34:16.570 --> 00:34:18.240
(Kim Se-hyun)

442
00:34:34.250 --> 00:34:35.160
This notebook...

443
00:34:36.380 --> 00:34:37.460
It's the one I was going to throw away.

444
00:34:40.480 --> 00:34:41.420
Thank you.

445
00:34:48.790 --> 00:34:50.460
How dare you trick me, damn it.

446
00:34:53.900 --> 00:34:55.489
It's you, isn't it?

447
00:34:55.490 --> 00:34:56.530
Welding mask.

448
00:35:08.950 --> 00:35:11.590
Wow, what a psychopath.

449
00:35:12.020 --> 00:35:13.050
Give it back.

450
00:35:14.990 --> 00:35:18.069
Meteor Vocational High School couldn't secure its enrollment quota again this year.

451
00:35:18.070 --> 00:35:21.069
Inspector, but in a difficult employment situation like recently,

452
00:35:21.070 --> 00:35:22.419
our employment rate, no matter who you compare it to,

453
00:35:22.420 --> 00:35:25.419
is second to none.

454
00:35:25.420 --> 00:35:27.589
Anyway, I hope you know

455
00:35:27.590 --> 00:35:30.680
that we have always been paying close attention to Meteor Vocational High School.

456
00:35:31.250 --> 00:35:33.119
That is rather an honor for us.

457
00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:35.249
Since you care so much about our school,

458
00:35:35.250 --> 00:35:38.830
we manage the campus with even more dedication.

459
00:35:45.680 --> 00:35:48.120
What's going on? Why isn't it cleaned up yet?

460
00:35:49.500 --> 00:35:50.450
- Inspector. - Teacher Lee.

461
00:35:50.451 --> 00:35:52.570
The practice building is this way.

462
00:35:54.350 --> 00:35:56.359
Inspector.

463
00:35:56.360 --> 00:35:57.610
Wait a minute.

464
00:36:01.010 --> 00:36:02.060
Me?

465
00:36:02.590 --> 00:36:03.640
Me?

466
00:36:05.780 --> 00:36:06.730
Teacher.

467
00:36:07.320 --> 00:36:09.279
Have we met somewhere before?

468
00:36:09.280 --> 00:36:10.609
How could that be?

469
00:36:10.610 --> 00:36:13.250
She's a substitute teacher who just arrived not long ago.

470
00:36:14.500 --> 00:36:15.959
S-Sorry.

471
00:36:15.960 --> 00:36:17.659
I don't remember.

472
00:36:17.660 --> 00:36:18.849
Is that so?

473
00:36:18.850 --> 00:36:19.929
She looks very familiar.

474
00:36:19.930 --> 00:36:21.009
Inspector.

475
00:36:21.010 --> 00:36:22.729
Let's quickly go to the practice building.

476
00:36:22.730 --> 00:36:25.730
We have completely replaced everything with equipment that can actually be used in the field.

477
00:36:39.940 --> 00:36:41.310
Um... Inspector.

478
00:36:41.710 --> 00:36:42.550
Inspector.

479
00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:47.580
Hey.

480
00:36:48.860 --> 00:36:50.350
Everyone except this guy, get the hell out.

481
00:36:55.650 --> 00:36:56.860
Come out.

482
00:37:01.030 --> 00:37:02.330
What are you standing there for?

483
00:37:02.820 --> 00:37:04.050
Do you want to get beaten again?

484
00:37:08.510 --> 00:37:09.750
I'm fine.

485
00:37:23.240 --> 00:37:24.410
Give that to me first.

486
00:37:28.210 --> 00:37:29.300
Go to hell.

487
00:37:45.150 --> 00:37:46.850
Look at me! Where are you looking?

488
00:37:51.540 --> 00:37:52.729
Was Lee Hyun-woo just pushed?

489
00:37:52.730 --> 00:37:54.049
Impossible. He just got lucky and hit him, right?

490
00:37:54.050 --> 00:37:56.070
But is there someone this strong in our class?

491
00:37:56.450 --> 00:37:57.360
Yoon Jiamin.

492
00:37:57.361 --> 00:37:59.199
Rank 222.

493
00:37:59.200 --> 00:38:00.810
He's absolute trash.

494
00:38:03.040 --> 00:38:04.850
That f***ing punk.

495
00:38:11.960 --> 00:38:12.940
You can't!

496
00:38:32.810 --> 00:38:34.059
Apologize.

497
00:38:34.060 --> 00:38:35.100
What?

498
00:38:35.980 --> 00:38:37.579
I told you to apologize to Se-hyun.

499
00:38:37.580 --> 00:38:38.510
Se-hyun?

500
00:38:39.250 --> 00:38:40.400
Who is that?

501
00:38:52.180 --> 00:38:54.020
You're dead meat.

502
00:40:07.020 --> 00:40:08.210
Don't pass out.

503
00:40:08.990 --> 00:40:10.630
Pass out only after you apologize to Se-hyun.

504
00:40:11.340 --> 00:40:12.389
Wake up.

505
00:40:12.390 --> 00:40:13.609
Who is Se-hyun?

506
00:40:13.610 --> 00:40:14.530
I don't know.

507
00:40:17.480 --> 00:40:20.039
I want... to go to a regular high school.

508
00:40:20.040 --> 00:40:21.149
Heh.

509
00:40:21.150 --> 00:40:23.500
I'm really going crazy.

510
00:40:23.920 --> 00:40:25.989
Go to a regular high school, and then what?

511
00:40:25.990 --> 00:40:26.810
Coll...

512
00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:29.630
Do you still want to go to college?

513
00:40:35.850 --> 00:40:36.700
Shh.

514
00:40:37.950 --> 00:40:40.730
He fell asleep while studying.

515
00:40:41.370 --> 00:40:45.300
This is my first time seeing a student from Meteor Vocational High School come to the library.

516
00:40:45.740 --> 00:40:46.520
Seriously.

517
00:41:05.610 --> 00:41:06.440
Grandma.

518
00:41:07.370 --> 00:41:08.360
Wait a minute.

519
00:41:09.700 --> 00:41:10.370
Sorry.

520
00:41:10.371 --> 00:41:12.010
I accidentally threw away the wrong thing.

521
00:41:14.840 --> 00:41:16.130
This belongs to a friend...

522
00:41:36.410 --> 00:41:38.020
Se-hyun, I'm sorry.

523
00:41:40.360 --> 00:41:41.630
The notebook...

524
00:41:52.100 --> 00:41:52.930
What does this little thing matter?

525
00:41:52.931 --> 00:41:54.330
Did you have to go that far?

526
00:41:57.590 --> 00:41:59.160
But that's the notebook you took so seriously.

527
00:42:01.200 --> 00:42:04.000
You really organized it in a way that makes people want to study hard.

528
00:42:05.150 --> 00:42:06.509
All that effort turned into ashes...

529
00:42:06.510 --> 00:42:07.580
I'll join.

530
00:42:11.560 --> 00:42:12.050
What?

531
00:42:12.051 --> 00:42:14.390
I said I want to join the study group.

532
00:42:21.550 --> 00:42:22.480
Really?

533
00:42:23.120 --> 00:42:27.160
"Study Group"

534
